        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Add Factory/Droid API-key usage auth",
        "body": "## Summary\n- Add Droid usage source modes `Auto | API key | Browser cookies`, with Settings API key field and `codexbar config set-api-key --provider factory` / `FACTORY_API_KEY` / optional `~/.factory/.env` resolution.\n- Reuse the existing Factory bearer billing-limits path for API keys; Auto prefers API when a key is available and falls back to cookies/WorkOS on missing/unauthorized credentials **and other recoverable API failures** (timeouts, DNS/network, 5xx, parse). Explicit `api` mode stays strict.\n- Preserve API-host 401/403 across app-host fallback retries so Auto web fallback is not masked by later 404 noise.\n- Unify `FactoryStatusProbeError` cases for Linux CLI builds and rename `FactoryApi*` → `FactoryAPI*` to match repo naming.\n\n## Deliberate notes\n- **Source modes:** Factory previously advertised `[.auto, .cli]` while only implementing a web strategy. This PR switches to `[.auto, .api, .web]` and **keeps `.cli` as an Auto compatibility alias** so persisted `source: cli` configs keep validating / dispatching (Settings UI still normalizes to Auto).\n- **Auto account precedence:** Prefer API with safe web fallback (Amp-style). When both an API key and a browser/WorkOS session exist, Auto may surface the API-key account; pin with explicit `web` or `api`.\n- **Linux:** API-key bearer HTTP works on Linux CLI; browser-cookie/WorkOS remains macOS-only. Auto/cli skips the Linux web gate when a Factory API key is resolvable.\n- **Docs:** `docs/factory.md` corrects the subscription usage endpoint from POST to GET to match the probe.\n\n## Fork / prior review\n- Fork PR (reviews already addressed): https://github.com/araa47/CodexBar/pull/1\n- Rebased onto latest `steipete/CodexBar` main before opening this PR; re-merged latest main after ClawSweeper review.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `make check`\n- [x] `swift test --filter 'FactoryAPI|FactorySettingsReader'`\n- [x] Focused coverage: Auto/cli falls back on network/parse/unauthorized; explicit API does not; cancellation does not\n- [x] CLI smoke: `CodexBarCLI usage --provider factory --source api` with `FACTORY_API_KEY`\n- [x] CLI smoke: `usage --provider factory --source web` without forcing API key\n- [x] Local `CodexBar.app` packaged/launched; Settings UI (Usage source + API key) checked\n- [x] Redacted packaged-app proof screenshots attached (Settings source picker + secure API key; details `Source: api`; menu usage) — see `docs/screenshots/factory-api-key-*.png`\n- [x] Codex gpt-5.6-sol + Claude fable review findings addressed (Linux enum + API casing, 401/403 host fallback)\n- [x] ClawSweeper P1: restore recoverable Auto→web fallback\n- [ ] CI `build-linux-cli` on this PR\n",
